<main class="wrap">

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <h1 class="rv">We fund <a href="#thesis"><span class="nw">agent-native</span> applications</a><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span> at the idea stage, and get founders to their <a href="#mondays">next round in four weeks</a>.</h1>
  <p class="sub rv">First checks of <b>$30–80k</b> on a SAFE. One form, four Mondays, a decision with an explanation either way.</p>
  <div class="cta rv"><a class="pill pill-dark" href="{{ fund.fund.apply_url }}">Apply for funding</a><a class="quiet" href="#mondays">How it works</a></div>
  <p class="proof rv">{% for c in fund.portfolio.companies %}<a href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ c.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</p>
</section>

<section class="big" id="thesis">
  <p class="t scrub" data-scrub>{{ fund.thesis.lead }} {{ fund.thesis.body }}</p>
  <p class="t muted rv">We back two kinds of products. <b>Products agents use</b><span class="tag">research</span><span class="tag">data</span><span class="tag">buy</span><span class="tag">sell</span>, and <b>tools for agent products</b><span class="tag">build</span><span class="tag">test</span><span class="tag">secure</span><span class="tag">launch</span>.</p>
  <p class="t muted rv" id="who">We look for founders who are moving from vibe coding to building a company of <b>people and agents</b>, and can run both. In practice, five things:</p>
  <ol class="five rv">
    {% for c in fund.who_we_look_for.criteria %}<li><span class="n">{{ loop.index }}</span><b>{{ c.name }}.</b> {{ c.detail }}</li>{% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="big" id="mondays">
  <p class="t rv">The program is <b>four Mondays</b>. We do not teach and we do not build your product. We watch how you work, then decide, and tell you why either way.</p>
  <ol class="mondays">
    <li class="rv"><span class="mn">1</span><div><b>Baseline.</b> The key number we will follow, cash and runway, who sells. The partner toolkit opens: cloud credits, coding and app-building tools, prospecting, docs.</div></li>
    <li class="rv"><span class="mn">2</span><div><b>Numbers.</b> Users, paying customers, revenue, customer conversations and how many in the US, deals, investor talks, cash. Did you reach last week's goal? What did you ship?</div></li>
    <li class="rv"><span class="mn">3</span><div><b>Your questions.</b> The same set plus up to three about your company. About 15 minutes. Text, voice, a screenshot or a file. Reply by Friday; we do not remind.</div></li>
    <li class="rv"><span class="mn">4</span><div><b>Decision.</b> Our agent summarises the four weeks: what moved, what you did yourselves, whether you answered on time. The partners decide and tell you why.</div></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="t muted rv">Before the Mondays: one form, read by our partner within 24 hours and by a person within three business days. No equity, no exclusivity, no fees for the track.</p>
</section>

<section class="big" id="check">
  <p class="t rv">If we invest: a first check of <b class="orange">$30–80k</b> on a standard post-money SAFE, help setting up a Delaware company and clean documents, and the founder platform: <b>weekly fund meeting, 1:1s with the general partner, guilds, 400+ partner perks</b>, and introductions to the next investors when you are ready to raise.</p>
  <p class="t muted rv">No follow-on checks from the fund. Our job is to get you to the next round from other investors.</p>
</section>

<section class="big" id="partner">
  <p class="t rv">The fund runs on its own agents. <span class="w mono">intake</span>. <span class="w ul">deck analysis</span>. <span class="w orange">check-ins</span>. <span class="w box">memos</span>. <span class="w mono">tracking</span>. Agents prepare, partners decide.</p>
  <p class="t muted rv">Your agent can read us too: everything on this page is in <a href="/agents/">a version for agents</a>, <a href="/agents.md">agents.md</a> and <a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>. Soon: upload a deck, and the application fills itself.</p>
</section>

<section class="big" id="portfolio">
  <p class="t rv"><b>{{ fund.portfolio.companies | length }} companies</b> building for agents and with agents.</p>
  <ul class="plist">
    {% for c in fund.portfolio.companies %}<li class="rv"><a href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>{{ c.name }}</b><span>{{ c.for_humans }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="big" id="faq">
  <p class="t rv">Questions founders ask.</p>
  <div class="qs rv">
    {% for f in fund.faq %}<details class="q"><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}</p></details>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="big last" id="apply">
  <p class="t rv">One form. Four Mondays. A decision either way.</p>
  <div class="cta rv"><a class="pill pill-dark" href="{{ fund.fund.apply_url }}">Apply for funding</a><a class="quiet" href="mailto:{{ fund.fund.email }}">{{ fund.fund.email }}</a></div>
</section>

</main>
